This directory holds Alembic migration scripts.

The initial migration isn't checked in yet: it's generated by running
`alembic revision --autogenerate -m "initial schema"` against the models in
app/models/, which requires SQLAlchemy/Alembic actually installed (see
backend/README.md). Generate it once, review the autogenerated diff against
app/models/ before committing, then `alembic upgrade head`.
